---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Learn bridge | Joondalup Bridge Club" description="Beginner lessons and starter sessions at Joondalup Bridge Club.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Start learning</p>
    <h1>Learn bridge</h1>
    <p>New to bridge or returning after a break? Learn the basics, practise in a friendly setting and find a regular game.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section page-content">
    <div class="content-columns education-columns">
      <article class="feature-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Beginner course</p>
        <h2>Start with the basics</h2>
        <p>Our next beginner classes are expected in January 2027. Dates and enrolment details will be announced closer to the time.</p>
        <p>The course usually runs on Monday evenings over nine lessons. The $80 course fee includes the handbook, homework exercises and weekly lesson materials.</p>
        <p>Lessons cover the basics of Acol bidding and supervised play. From lesson four, learners can also practise at the Wednesday evening starter session.</p>
        <a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:lessonsjbc@gmail.com">Ask about lessons <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
      <article class="feature-card starter-card">
        <p class="eyebrow">Try a game</p><h2>Wednesday Starter Session</h2>
        <p>A relaxed, supervised session for newer players. You don’t need to bring a partner; a supervisor or teacher will play if needed.</p>
        <p><strong>Wednesday at 7:00 pm</strong></p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/sessions/">See all session times <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="club-links-grid education-resources">
      <a class="club-link-card" href="https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/1fbsvs9gvh6yj9ppkfoys/FAQ-Bridge-lessons.pdf?rlkey=weuw4974pjtddrz7oj2ed11dm&st=xo7uzvi0&dl=0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="eyebrow">Course information</span><strong>Beginner lessons FAQ</strong><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
      <a class="club-link-card" href="https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/rsn20elvy2p6qtxyli0fp/General-Info-Bridge.pdf?rlkey=tithr7w9aamh26n89uxbiud81&st=2fqj9jtb&dl=0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="eyebrow">Getting started</span><strong>General information about bridge</strong><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
    </div>
    <div class="welcome-band education-band"><div class="welcome-mark" aria-hidden="true">♠</div><div><p class="eyebrow">Ready to learn?</p><h2>We’ll help you find your feet.</h2><p>No experience is needed to get started. Get in touch and we’ll help you choose the right next step.</p></div><a class="button button-light" href="mailto:lessonsjbc@gmail.com">Contact the lessons team <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
